@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Aggregate boundary: root, members and invariant
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "Candidate draft aggregate" {
 class ResumeDraft <<root>>
 class ConfirmedSelection <<immutable value>>
 class DraftVersion <<immutable value>>
 ResumeDraft *-- ConfirmedSelection : controls replacement
 ResumeDraft *-- DraftVersion : current value
 note bottom of ResumeDraft
  Root guards exact expected version and selected changes.
  Preserve independent overrides and unrelated resumes.
 end note
}
class PublishedResumeRevision <<separate identity>>
class SubmissionMaterialSet <<other owner>>
ResumeDraft ..> PublishedResumeRevision : explicit publication operation only
PublishedResumeRevision ..> SubmissionMaterialSet : no mutable aggregate membership

@enduml
